<title>USA: Harte-Hanks Communications Inc Q1 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Harte-Hanks Communications Inc Q1 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.26		    $0.22</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 0.26		     0.22</p>
<p> Net			 10,017		    8,317</p>
<p> Revs		     174,835		  150,611</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	38,734		   38,289</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	38,811		   38,288</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q1 1996 results have been restated to include DiMark Inc, which merged with a wholly owned subsidiary of Harte-Hanks on April 30, 1996 and was accounted for on a pooling-of-interests basis.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
